abstract: >-
  Six classical models and a five-node distributed LightGBM system evaluated on NASA C-MAPSS
  FD001 to FD004: classification, robustness, cross-dataset transfer, RUL regression and
  deployment cost. Companion material for a manuscript in preparation.
keywords:
  - predictive maintenance
  - C-MAPSS
  - cyber-physical systems
